OL,3,APowerful earthquake hits Tibet, killing
OL,4,A16 people, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA magnitude 7.0 earthquake with a depth
OL,7,Fof 10km has hit a mountainous region in
OL,8,FTibet, killing at least 16 people,
OL,9,Faccording to Chinese state media
OL,11,FAuthorities have declared an emergency
OL,12,Fand deployed rescue teams to the area,
OL,13,Fwhere 65 people have been injured
OL,15,FState media is often the only source of
OL,16,Finformation on Tibet, which is tightly
OL,17,Fcontrolled by China since it was
OL,18,Fannexed in the 1950s
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
